Soft-Span BBS's main menu contains many commands through which users access
the system.  In addition to the commands listed on the main menu (called
PRIMARY commands), there are alternative names for most of the commands.
For instance, someone may enter SEND USER to send mail to the user named
"USER", which is equivalent to the command MAIL USER.  For a full listing
of commands and their aliases, enter ALIAS at the main menu.  The primary
command will be displayed, then a colon, then its aliases, separated by blank
spaces.  To view only the aliases for a particular primary command, enter
ALIAS <primary>, where <primary> is the primary command.  If you know the
name of an alias and wish to find its primary command, enter ALIAS <alias>,
where <alias> is the command name you know.
